{"unit_id":"v1xingyue__dsh-auth-plugin#card-zh","repo":"v1xingyue/dsh-auth-plugin","commit":"dec45bf6132e60d05b563750c42b5b80b36e67fa","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Auth Plugin（DSH Web 插件）：为 DSH Web GUI 提供登录认证，在 WebServer 上注册登录与退出接口，并为静态页面请求加上会话门卫。支持用户名密码登录、Solana 钱包签名登录、EVM 钱包登录和通用 OAuth 2.0 授权码流程；通过 HttpOnly Cookie 维护会话。适合需要为 DSH Web 加登录入口的部署者，可按需启用钱包白名单或 OAuth provider。使用 OAuth 需配置 client ID、secret 与 provider 端点；EVM 需可选的 noble 库。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:819-889","lib/index.js:891-1088","lib/index.js:1091-1248","lib/index.js:1251-1309"]}
