{"unit_id":"v1xingyue__dsh-auth-plugin#feature-password","repo":"v1xingyue/dsh-auth-plugin","commit":"dec45bf6132e60d05b563750c42b5b80b36e67fa","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Auth Plugin 的功能「用户名密码登录」：用户可提交 JSON 或表单凭据，插件校验后签发会话 Cookie；浏览器表单登录成功会跳转到首页。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:819-889"]}
{"unit_id":"v1xingyue__dsh-auth-plugin#feature-oauth","repo":"v1xingyue/dsh-auth-plugin","commit":"dec45bf6132e60d05b563750c42b5b80b36e67fa","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Auth Plugin 的功能「OAuth 登录」：访问 provider 的 start 路径后跳转授权页，回调以授权码换令牌并获取用户信息，成功后建立会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1091-1248"]}
{"unit_id":"v1xingyue__dsh-auth-plugin#feature-solana","repo":"v1xingyue/dsh-auth-plugin","commit":"dec45bf6132e60d05b563750c42b5b80b36e67fa","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Auth Plugin 的功能「Solana 钱包登录」：用户先请求一次性 challenge，再提交签名；服务端校验白名单、公钥和签名后建立会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:891-989"]}
{"unit_id":"v1xingyue__dsh-auth-plugin#feature-evm","repo":"v1xingyue/dsh-auth-plugin","commit":"dec45bf6132e60d05b563750c42b5b80b36e67fa","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Auth Plugin 的功能「EVM 钱包登录」：启用并具备可选加密库后，用户对 challenge 签名；服务端恢复地址并与白名单比对后建立会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:990-1088"]}
{"unit_id":"v1xingyue__dsh-auth-plugin#feature-gate","repo":"v1xingyue/dsh-auth-plugin","commit":"dec45bf6132e60d05b563750c42b5b80b36e67fa","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Auth Plugin 的功能「Web 会话门卫」：未登录访问页面会被引导到登录页，认证通过后请求交给原 WebServer fallback 处理。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1251-1309"]}
